      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Being a two storey A frame type house, my install was always going to be more difficult than most. Aus Solar Energy Group took the time to come to my property to inspect both inside and out and discussed with me at length how the installation would proceed. Because they were so prepared the install went very smoothly and the finished product looks fantastic. The panels have been mounted evenly on both sides, something other supplies said was impossible. The same inverter and wiring is neat and tidy and installed in such a way that it is not conspicuous from the front of the property. Aus Solar Energy prepared and submitted the necessary documents to my retailer to have the smart meter fitted which was fantastic.In all respects they were great to deal with and took time to listen to my requirements and worked to best accomodate them.I am very happy with the price paid and the quality of the install and would not hesitate to recommend them.",
