      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We had panels installed by AUS Solar Energy Group and were very happy with the job done. The initial contact was with their sales guy, Niall Garrett, who explained everything to us very well. Just as we were about to sign, I happened to ask about the panels and inverter being installed.  Both were mid range products so we upgraded (at not much greater cost) to products from the upper end of the market - Q-cells and an ABB Inverter. We happened to have all the documents available which we had to send to Solar Victoria for rebate approval. From the time we signed the contract, had the panels installed and then the government inspector to check all was good, was no more than three weeks.  The Installers were very nice guys and did a good job.",
